Modifications: TypeScript browser protocol/runtime, a portable ONNX export using
PyTorch, separated FP16 vocabulary embeddings, single-question execution, and a
minimal browser example. This is an independent port, not an official release
of Convai Innovations or laya-mlx.

Pretrained weights are downloaded separately from Convai Innovations on
Hugging Face (Apache-2.0). No weights are included in Git or the npm package.

The JavaScript build bundles @huggingface/tokenizers 0.2.0 by Hugging Face
(Apache-2.0). Local modifications restore Rust-compatible Metaspace split=true
and normalized=false added-token behavior. The patch is in patches/ and is
covered by reduced regression cases and reference-tokenizer comparisons.
